{"4380200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shear Heaven", "steam_appid": 4380200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform across sky islands</strong>! Jump, run and float on clouds across hand-crafted sky islands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/99a228be22c2cf71609aae1184cb9e7e.poster.avif?t=1782594507\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/99a228be22c2cf71609aae1184cb9e7e.webm?t=1782594507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/99a228be22c2cf71609aae1184cb9e7e.mp4?t=1782594507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shear quirky sheep</strong>! Chase and shear fluffy sheep to collect their wool. Time your movements and watch how they react.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/84ba116270a4630e7721af4f75f4977f.poster.avif?t=1782594507\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/84ba116270a4630e7721af4f75f4977f.webm?t=1782594507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380200/extras/84ba116270a4630e7721af4f75f4977f.mp4?t=1782594507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover collectible outfits!</strong> F